<!-- ========================================================================
     DROIDWORKS_FINE_PARTS_1 (packet B4a). Ruling 5 ("Parts: FINE from the
     start — limbs, sensors, motivators") and section 1.3's part set (Leg/
     Arm/Manipulator, Sensor, Motivator, PowerCell, Servo). Generic across
     families, not per-family reskins - a spare servo is spare salvage
     regardless of which droid it came from (unlike a head, which carries
     irreplaceable identity - DROIDWORKS_HEADS_BRAINS_SPIKES_1). Arm and
     Manipulator are collapsed to one item (the design text lists them as
     one slot idea, "Leg/Arm/Manipulator", not three mandatory ones).

     Each carries CompProperties_Quality - CompDWPartDropper (Source/
     Droidworks/CompDWPartDropper.cs) sets the actual quality at drop time
     via QualityUtility.GenerateQualityTraderItem(), the same vanilla method
     found-loot uses. Effects (Source/Droidworks/Recipe_InstallDroidPart.cs)
     read that quality back at install time to pick which of three
     Inferior/Standard/Superior HediffDefs to grant (Effects_Droidworks.xml)
     - "superior/inferior parts change stats" (section 1.3).

     PowerCell carries no install recipe or hediff (no mechanical hook the
     design specifies for it beyond flavor/market value) - FOUNDRY's own
     scope call, recorded in the item file.
======================================================================== -->
<Defs>

  <ThingDef ParentName="ResourceBase">
    <defName>RSW_DW_Part_Leg</defName>
    <label>droid leg actuator</label>
    <description>A salvaged droid leg actuator - the joint and drive assembly that does the walking. Quality tells: a Legendary one moves like it isn't there; an Awful one drags.</description>
    <graphicData>
      <texPath>OuterRim/Items/DroidBodyPart_Standard</texPath>
      <graphicClass>Graphic_Single</graphicClass>
    </graphicData>
    <statBases>
      <Mass>1.0</Mass>
      <MaxHitPoints>50</MaxHitPoints>
      <Flammability>0.4</Flammability>
      <MarketValue>120</MarketValue>
    </statBases>
    <techLevel>Spacer</techLevel>
    <thingCategories>
      <li>Manufactured</li>
    </thingCategories>
    <comps>
      <li>
        <compClass>CompQuality</compClass>
      </li>
    </comps>
  </ThingDef>

